BOUNDARY Current.RMALSIR2 CLAIM_CEILING DESIGN_SPEC REASON "proposed successor IR until implementation parity and proof-carrying acceptance criteria are met"
BOUNDARY Current.EyeOfStorm CLAIM_CEILING RESEARCH_SCAFFOLD REASON "five-eye/quadrocloptic lens is a reconstruction/search scaffold, not a proof of arbitrary 4D reconstruction"
BOUNDARY Current.RippingManyArmsOff CLAIM_CEILING ACTIVE_PROJECT_ONLY REASON "game-project status carries no scientific evidence authority"

