CLAIM ContextCrack.C1 STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "Pass 1 naming universe compiles under RMALC 1.3 without modifying its recovered records."
CLAIM ContextCrack.C2 STATUS DECLARED TEXT "the five kernels are a processing basis, not semantic identity classes for the projects they route."
CLAIM ContextCrack.C3 STATUS DECLARED TEXT "one-machine composition preserves project distinctions, evidence ceilings, lineage and unresolved remainder."
BOUNDARY ContextCrack.Root CLAIM_CEILING BOUNDED_CONTEXT_INTEGRATION REASON "this integration compresses the declared recovered/current context; it does not prove semantic completeness over all past or future human knowledge"

PRESERVE identity distinctions obligations invariants provenance history failures unknowns unresolved_remainder claim_ceilings
ALLOW retrieve formulate generate rotate fit constrain solve meta_solve polymeta counterprobe verify admit build compile link run debug reconstruct continue
EXCLUDE silent_identity_merge silent_evidence_transfer authority_amplification hidden_oracle hidden_cost finite_to_universal_promotion p_eq_np_claim_promotion
REMAINDER "Unrecovered conversations, unresolved xrefs, unimplemented RMAL-SIR2/POLYMETA proof machinery, and open mathematical claims remain explicit remainder."